Package: anxos-agent
Version: {{VERSION}}
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: {{ARCH}}
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28), libstdc++6
Recommends: ca-certificates
Installed-Size: {{INSTALLED_SIZE}}
Maintainer: AnxOS <noreply@anxos.local>
Homepage: https://anxoscontrolcenter.org
Description: AnxOS Agent - remote control endpoint for AnxOS Control Center
 The AnxOS Agent is the headless server-side endpoint used by AnxOS Control
 Center to manage instances, Docker workloads, backups and public access on a
 Debian or Ubuntu host. It bundles an official Node.js 22 LTS Linux runtime and
 installs as a systemd service listening on 127.0.0.1:47131 by default.
 .
 Remote network access is opt-in through /etc/anxos-agent/agent.env.
 User data lives in /var/lib/anxos-agent and /var/log/anxos-agent and is
 deliberately preserved by both remove and purge.
